{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"schema\": \"aos-material-review/v1\", \"request_id\": \"qyh-customer-visual-pointer-20261015-design-r2\", \"task_id\": \"qyh-customer-visual-pointer-20261015\", \"owner\": \"codex-01a13484-f019-7d82-94ce-812396db9124\", \"kind\": \"route\", \"baseline\": {\"head\": \"bb7a742849f9109ad4fc2f9ed9e9cfd55ffbac3a\", \"authority_revision\": \"AOS-002039\", \"files\": {\".evidence/qyh-customer-visual-pointer-20261015/design-review-material-r2.txt\": \"50c3820bd8f38c35bf38b8ba52e89e2ad8570ebff4d58b53fe98d2f344362333\"}}, \"claims\": [\"Plan localizes proven customer filter pointer interception to absolute tablist transparent padding; scoped parent pointer-events none plus actual buttons auto preserves layout/focus/customer failure buttons without other module/data/authority changes. Nonbutton descendants and global CSS risks constrained.\", \"Plan distinguishes unverified tab no-op from proven geometry failure; exact owned-target recovery and actual normal pointer/keyboard/aria diagnosis required, focus emulation only if warranted and cleared finally, no guessed component change or forced/DOM click acceptance.\", \"Registered scope and future RED/frozen/adjacent component-type-build/independent quality/guarded Web switch/current three-width browser-original/live review/Delivery gates implementable. Pre-code review only, no future code or test evidence claimed; complete231Goal/daily original-volume fullPGAPIWeb/hard boundaries preserved.\"], \"materials\": {\".evidence/qyh-customer-visual-pointer-20261015/design-review-material-r2.txt\": \"PRE-IMPLEMENTATION CUSTOMER POINTER DESIGN ONLY. Full231Goal ACTIVE. CSS unchanged; tab no-op cause unverified; no speculative component edits, no force/DOM click acceptance. Previous oversized draft rejected before request/attempt.\\n# 客户工作台筛选遮挡与页签状态诊断\\n\\n## Rules 与承接\\n\\n使用AOS工程交付闭环、Product Design audit已捕获原图、CDP Bridge及231完整串行计划。Authority2039登记唯一写者codex